   "text": "origin: published · sequence 1  (small text)\nNames are derived from the cycle. They sit beside the loaded references of the\nsame name; the tool keeps them apart by identity.\nHandoff file also carries P and A as copies of R and C: yes / no  (read-only,\nserver configuration)",
